  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mango chutney is a spiced preserve that balances sweetness from ripe mango and sugar with vinegar sharpness. It works alongside curries, with cold meats, in cheese sandwiches, and stirred through cream cheese. The mangoes break down during cooking,  some into thick sauce, some remaining in chunks. Makes about three 300 g jars."
          }
        ]
      },
